@startuml
title APT-SD-D10 Manual Release Governance Handoff Flow
skinparam shadowing false

actor Cashier
participant "Assisted Payment Terminal" as APT
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Operator Console /\napproved operations workflow" as OC
participant "Supervisor" as Sup
participant "Audit / Reconciliation" as Audit
participant "Gate / physical release boundary" as Gate

APT -> Central : receive exception / blocked exit context
Cashier -> APT : request supervisor assistance
APT -> OC : hand off exception context
OC -> Sup : request review / approval where policy allows
alt approved manual release
  Sup --> OC : approval + reason
  OC -> Audit : incident/audit/reconciliation tags
  OC --> APT : display governed handoff status
  OC --> Gate : execution boundary only if separately approved
else rejected / pending
  OC --> APT : display rejected or pending status
end

note bottom
APT does not directly operate gates.
Operator Console remains non-payment governance.
end note
@enduml
